Living Vines summons animated plant tendrils that ensnare and bind the
target. Unlike the rigid roots of Root Control, these vines are supple
and flexible, wrapping around the victim to restrict their movement.

Usage: cast 'living vines' <target>

The conjured vines grasp at the target, potentially immobilizing them or
at minimum hindering their combat effectiveness. Bound targets have
difficulty attacking and defending, making this spell excellent for
controlling dangerous opponents.

The vines draw on the caster's magical energy to maintain their animation.
Stronger targets may eventually break free, but even temporary restraint
can turn the tide of battle.

Class: Mage
Discipline: Earth

